     "title": "Plasma fireballs formed by microwave interference in air",
     "u": "https://www.nature.com/articles/350139a0",
     "kind": "academica",
     "accessed": "2026-11-26",
     "note": "Pese a muchos estudios, no hay una explicación del rayo globular ampliamente aceptada.",
